{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19200","headline":"酬乐天斋满日裴令公置宴席上戏赠 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬乐天斋满日裴令公置宴席上戏赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一月道场斋戒满，今朝华幄管弦迎。\n衔杯本自多狂态，事佛无妨有佞名。\n酒力半酣愁已散，文锋未钝老犹争。\n平阳不独容宾醉，听取喧呼吏舍声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19200.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19200","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}